-- 12 players with pre-computed playing handicaps
-- PH formula: round((index * 128/113 + (71.2 - 72)) * 0.85)
-- Player 1: index 12 → round((12*1.1327 + -0.8)*0.85) = round((13.59 - 0.8)*0.85) = round(10.87) = 11
-- Player 2: index 24 → 22 (verified in tests)
-- Player 3: index 18 → round((18*1.1327 + -0.8)*0.85) = round((20.39 - 0.8)*0.85) = round(16.65) = 17
-- Player 4: index 8  → round((8*1.1327 + -0.8)*0.85) = round((9.06 - 0.8)*0.85) = round(7.02) = 7

